<BaseLayout current="/" description="Richard J. Allen is an operations and people leader with experience in customer success, SaaS support, process improvement, change management, training, analytics, and cross-functional execution.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Operations Management · Customer Success · Process Improvement · People Leadership</div>
    <h1>Helping people, processes, customers, and operations work better together.</h1>
    <p class="lede">I’m Richard Allen, an operations and customer-success leader based in Oregon. My background combines direct people management, SaaS/software support, customer experience, process improvement, project coordination, operational reporting, training, supply operations, and change leadership. I’m strongest in work where teams need structure, performance needs to be measurable, and complex operations need to become clearer and more repeatable.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/case-studies/">View selected work</a><a class="button secondary" href="/resume/">View résumé</a><a class="button secondary" href="/contact/">Contact</a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card"><div class="metric">32</div><div class="metric-label">Customer Support and Technical Support representatives managed at HawkSoft</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="metric">100</div><div class="metric-label">new SOPs created, plus 25+ legacy SOPs corrected and standardized</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="metric">400+</div><div class="metric-label">workforce position records managed across multiple divisions</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="metric">20+</div><div class="metric-label">recurring and specialized workforce reports maintained for leadership</div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <h2>Where I add value</h2>
    <div class="grid two">
      <article class="card"><h3>Operations & people management</h3><p>Promoted to Customer Support Manager in 2015 with direct hiring, firing, discipline, performance, workflow, quality, coaching, and operational responsibility. Earlier warehouse-management experience adds supply, inventory, driver, and mixed-workforce leadership.</p><a href="/operations-leadership/">Operations & leadership →</a></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Customer success & SaaS leadership</h3><p>Customer relationships, technical support, escalations, training, software adoption, customer-lifecycle work, retention improvement, and leadership of a 32-person Customer Support and Technical Support organization.</p><a href="/customer-success/">Customer success experience →</a></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Process improvement & governance</h3><p>Led a year-long SOP program, created 100 new SOPs, repaired 25+ legacy SOPs, built the repository and governance model, improved QA controls, and helped modernize earlier tracking and digitization processes.</p><a href="/process-improvement/">Process improvement work →</a></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Change, implementation & enablement</h3><p>Project-managed software migrations, prepared teams for major product changes, validated software builds, coordinated developers and support staff, and created training, procedures, and customer-facing instructional content.</p><a href="/implementation-enablement/">Implementation & enablement →</a></article>
