  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <div class="callout">
      <strong>Leadership beyond the workplace.</strong> Volunteer hospital chaplaincy, youth mentoring, community administration, and disaster-response service have reinforced the same habits I value professionally: listening, organizing, mentoring, communicating clearly, and helping people through difficult situations. <a href="/community-leadership/">See community & volunteer leadership →</a>
    </div>
  </div></section>
